00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.640
Yes.

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:54.570
You know, the same kind of thing can happen
with COVID where there.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:59.350
You know, marginalizing of certain groups
because they're seen as the cause.

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:08.390
You know, so we saw that with with Asian Americans
earlier in the pandemic and so forth.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:14.880
And so, you know, I think that the disgust
can be weaponized in whatever way is convenient

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:20.269
for particular, you know, political groups
interests.

00:10:20.269 --> 00:10:25.350
So sometimes you get things that are sort
of nonsensical, you know, where it seems like

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:29.920
people are really acting against their own
best interests.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:30.920
Speaker 1: Yeah.

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.080
Or even their predispositions.

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:38.690
But interestingly, there was a sense of disgust
about the masks by some of the folks who did

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:39.690
not see.

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:40.690
Right.

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:41.690
The feeling of the mask.

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:45.790
And it's restricting my breathing and I'm
re breathing my own carbon dioxide.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:54.459
Related to this, does one's willingness to
accept a medical myth treatment, you know,

00:10:54.459 --> 00:11:00.700
scam treatment or whatever the case may be,
relate to how disgusted or put off they are

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:04.470
